{"id": 18997, "group": "campus-iit-madras-placements", "sent_at": "2026-11-02T13:16:01.684598+00:00", "text": "Flipkart's messaging service tags every outgoing message with a small per-character checksum so\ncorrupted characters can be spotted.\n•\n•\nYou are given a message msg (a char[] in C++, a list of characters in Python).\nFor each character, take its ASCII code and add up the decimal digits of that code (e.g. → 9 + 7 = 16).\n'a' → 97\nReturn: print the digit sum for each character, one by one, in order.\nEXAMPLES\nInput: msg = \"Hi\"\nOutput: 9\n6\nWhy: 'H' = 72 → 7+2 = 9, 'i' = 105 → 1+0+5 = 6\nInput: msg = \"a!\"\nOutput: 16\n6\nWhy: 'a' = 97 → 9+7 = 16, '!' = 33 → 3+3 = 6\nInput: msg = \"A\"\nOutput: 11\nWhy: single character: 'A' = 65 → 6+5 = 11", "author_tag": "BHU", "reply_to": {"id": 18441, "text": "capital one and flipkart ai engineer oa questions??", "author_tag": "IITK"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
